-risk way to ease vulvar and perineal soreness: ACOG recommends an ice pack or cold gel pack on the perineal area for 10 to 20 minutes at a time after birth, and a Cochrane review found cooling may reduce perineal pain in the first days postpartum (low-certainty evidence). VPod packages that idea as a curved silicone pod that stays in place in underwear.

